SUMMARY:2027 Medicine Mountain Summer Camp – Week 1
LOCATION:Medicine Mountain Scout Ranch\, Custer\, South Dakota
DESCRIPTION:Sioux Council\nhttps://global.scoutingevent.com/695-MMSR2027Su
 mmerCamp\n\nCamping\, Health Care Professions\n\nMedicine Mountain Scout 
 Ranch (MMSR) and the Medicine Mountain Adventure Base (MMAB) is 160 acres
  of Scouting paradise surrounded by 1.3 million acres of National Forest 
 Service land. Our camp rests like a jewel in the beautiful Black Hills of
  South Dakota. We boast a private fresh water lake stocked with trout\, c
 ountless miles of local trails for mountain biking and hiking\, breathtak
 ing views\, rustic serenity\, access to local natural-face rock for climb
 ing\, and access to both public and non-pub
URL:https://global.scoutingevent.com/695-MMSR2027SummerCamp
END:VEVENT
